"""Yoda: a small, local voice-control manager for GNOME/Wayland.

The window is deliberately a normal GTK window.  It starts a Voxtype child
process only while it is open, observes its state file, and offers an exact
allow-list for desktop commands.  All recognition stays local.
"""

